<title>CHINA: Shanghai Metal Exchange closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Metal Exchange closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Shanghai Metal Exchange is closed for two weeks, starting on Monday, for the lunar new year holiday.</p>
<p>On January 31, the most active May 1997 contract closed up 90 yuan to 21,580 yuan ($2,600) per tonne.</p>
</text>
